ent additions to our portfolio and a clear strategy for expansion, we are building a truly global platform that works for our customers. This planned growth positions us for a strong future, one where we can deliver greater reach, e…", "a": "Will Nihan, Chief Executive Officer, at IMG, said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1576018/000157601826000012/exhibit991-pressreleasepro.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-06", "n": 3.03, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We continue to build on our partnership with Arcadian through the extension of our capacity agreement and are excited to support the business in its next chapter under respected industry leader John Boylan.", "a": "Scott Egan, Chief Executive Officer at SiriusPoint, said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1576018/000119312525230845/d68415dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2024-05-23", "n": 7.25, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Jim’s deep and broad experience as a publicly listed CFO, and his understanding of operational excellence and transformation will be invaluable as we continue to improve our performance and execute our plans to deliver our ambition of being a best-in-class insurer and reinsurer.", "a": "Jim will report to Chief Executive Officer, Scott Egan, as a member of SiriusPoint’s Executive Leadership Team. Commenting on his appointmen", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1576018/000119312524146056/d826023dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2023-08-09", "n": 4.0, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We welcome the standstill agreement as a strong signal of support for the progress we are making towards creating long term value in our business and for our shareholders. Our recent half year results were an important evidence point of our strategy and our progress so far, and we are focused on building on that moment…", "a": "SiriusPoint CEO Scott Egan said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1576018/000110465923089325/tm2323297d1_ex99-1.htm"}, {"d": "2023-07-13", "n": 5.56, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Tom is already a key member of our Executive Leadership Team. I am delighted that he is stepping up to provide global oversight of our A&H portfolio which is a central part of our business.", "a": "SiriusPoint CEO, Scott Egan said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1576018/000157601823000092/a11july2023-tomleonardoelt.htm"}, {"d": "2023-03-02", "n": 3.3, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "This is a transformational deal for SiriusPoint. It demonstrates decisive and continuing execution against our strategic priorities of simplifying our business, reducing future volatility, and improving the profitability of our Company. By transferring these reserves, we are aligning our balance sheet to our go-forward…", "a": "Scott Egan, SiriusPoint Chief Executive Officer, said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1576018/000157601823000023/a02mar2023projectcascade-p.htm"}], "now": null}, "score": {"value": 46, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: +0.00 M$."}, {"it": "1 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "1 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-call transcripts."}], "coverage": "Assente"}, {"id": "market", "name": {"it"